.²1 To curse, execrate; {#aSapad Bava mAnuzIti tAm#} <ls>R. 8. 80</ls>; {#so'BUt#}
 {#parAsuraTa BUmipatiM SaSApa#} ({#vfdDaH#}) <ls n="R.">9. 78</ls>, <ls n="R.">1. 77</ls>.
.²2 To swear, take an oath, promise by oath, say on oath, (usually with
 <ab>dat.</ab> of the person to whom a promise <ab>&c.</ab> is made and <ab>instr.</ab> of the object
 by which it is made); {#BaratenAtmanA cAhaM Sape te manujADipa . yaTA#}
 {#nAnyena tuzyeyamfte rAmavivAsanAt ..#} <ls>Rām.</ls>; when used without an object
